### Notice on Distilled Content

The file `references/playbook.md` contains A-share trading methodology
distilled from publicly available community discussions. All personally
identifiable information (author names, post IDs, dates, quotations longer
than 15 characters) has been removed. Only reusable decision frameworks,
threshold rules, and archetypal case structures are retained.

If you believe any content in this repository infringes on your intellectual
property rights, please open an issue and the content will be reviewed and
removed if valid.
